35,2,1,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I found that only two people write all the notes by hand. That seems like a lot of extra work for them.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Jonathan,,"The developers are tied up until the third quarter, and half the customer sites lose signal for whole afternoons. That is a significant constraint.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,George,,"The capital line is frozen, but the software allowance has room. Per-head licences climb with every department added, while fixed-fee work has held steady for three years.","{""words"":27,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,May,,"So, the broad tools everyone has to use daily get abandoned, but the narrow ones for specific trades stick. That’s the pattern I was looking for.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Midori,,"An hour daily lost to copying, and eleven misrouted deliveries from duplicate records. These are quiet, daily drains that no one seems to be measuring.","{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Minato,,- **Minato**: I also found two clerks keep asking for the same certificate over and over. That feels like a lot of wasted time.,"{""words"":24,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Jonathan,,"@George, does the frozen capital line mean we cannot fund any new hardware or infrastructure at all?","{""words"":17,""mentions"":[""George""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, not entirely. The capital line is frozen, but the recurring software allowance still has room. We can fund software, just not new hardware.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,May,,"@Midori, your daily losses match my findings. Broad tools fail, narrow ones survive. We need a solution that fits that pattern.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Midori,,"@May, exactly. The narrow tools survive because they solve a specific, daily pain. We should look for a proposal that targets a single, measurable loss, not a grand system.","{""words"":29,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Minato,,"- **Minato**: I am a little worried. If we pick a big tool, will those two people have to do even more work?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Jonathan,,"@May, that pattern is worrying. If our developers are unavailable and site access is slow, how can we promise a reliable launch date?","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""May""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,George,,"@Jonathan, the frozen capital line means no new hardware. But the software allowance has room, and fixed-fee work is stable. We must avoid per-head licence traps.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,May,,"@Jonathan, the pattern is clear: broad tools fail, narrow ones survive. We need a proposal that fits that specific, daily pain.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Jonathan""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Midori,,"@Minato, I hear your worry. A narrow tool should actually free up those two people, not burden them further.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[""Minato""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Minato,,"@Midori, thank you. I feel a little better knowing it might help them. I am ready to see the candidates now.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Jonathan,,"I appreciate the clarity. The constraints are real, but the path forward seems to favor targeted, software-based solutions over broad infrastructure.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,George,,I agree. We must stay within the software allowance and avoid per-head costs. I am ready to see the candidates.,"{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,May,,"I’m ready to see the candidates. The pattern is clear: we need something narrow, software-based, and sustainable. Let’s see what fits.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Midori,,"I am ready to see the candidates. We need a solution that addresses these specific, daily losses without creating new burdens.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
